  m_text: "MISSION 2 - \u201CVALLEY OF DEATH\u201D\n\nYOU MANAGED TO CLEAR OUT THE
    MILITARY BASE. WELL DONE PILOT.\n\nNEXT, YOU ARE TO HEAD THROUGH VERDAN VALLEY
    TO THE EXTRACTION POINT.\n\nTHE ROADS AND SURROUNDINGS HAVE NOT BEEN MAINTAINED
    IN MANY YEARS, AND THE BUGS CONSTANT DIGGING HAS CAUSED MANY ROCKSLIDES IN THE
    AREA, SO BE CAREFUL."
